# Build output
/aimem
/aimem.exe
dist/
bin/

# Local databases (journals, memories) if a state root lands in the tree
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Local secrets: never commit these
.creds/
providers.json

# Temporary scripts and private working artifacts (see AGENTS.md)
/.work/

# aimem's OWN handoff. The installer creates docs/SESSION-STATE.md in every
# project it wires; the hub shares it, and a project keeps it out of Git
# (docs/QUICKSTART-NEW-PROJECT.md, step 3.5). Here it also carries
# hostnames and in-flight operational state.
docs/SESSION-STATE.md

# .aimem.json carries the operator's own hub binding and group membership,
# which are meaningless on anyone else's machine. A project commits it
# only when every clone registers the hub under the same name
# (docs/QUICKSTART-NEW-PROJECT.md, step 3.5).
.aimem.json

# PowerShell's module analysis cache, should a test's PowerShell ever write
# it inside the tree again (scripts/check-tool-caches.sh refuses it in CI)
ModuleAnalysisCache
